159: \r\n160:                             <div class=\"programming-languages\">\r\n161:                                 <h4>Preferred Programming Languages (Optional)</h4>\r\n162:                                 <div class=\"language-selector\">\r\n163:                                     <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n164:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"python\"> Python</label>\r\n165:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"javascript\">\r\n166:                                             JavaScript</label>\r\n167:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"java\"> Java</label>\r\n168:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"cpp\"> C++</label>\r\n169:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"csharp\"> C#</label>\r\n170:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"go\"> Go</label>\r\n171:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"rust\"> Rust</label>\r\n172:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"react or typescript\"> React\r\n173:                                             or TypeScript</label>\r\n174:                                         <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"language\" value=\"sql\"> SQL</label>\r\n175:                                     </div>\r\n176:                                 </div>\r\n177:                                 <small class=\"config-hint\">Select languages for code solutions and explanations</small>\r\n178:                             </div>\r\n179:                         </div>\r\n180:                     </fieldset>\r\n181:                 </div>\r\n182: \r\n183:                 <!-- Tab 3: Advanced Configuration -->\r\n184:                 <div id=\"advanced-config-tab\" class=\"tab-pane\">\r\n185:                     <fieldset>\r\n186:                         <legend>API Credentials & Model Management</legend>\r\n187:                         <div class=\"advanced-info-box\">\r\n188:                             <p>Manage raw API keys and model lists for all available providers. Changes saved here will\r\n189:                                 modify <code>ai_providers.json</code> and <code>.env</code>.</p>\r\n190:                         </div>\r\n191: \r\n192:                         <div class=\"deepgram-config\">\r\n193:                             <h4>Deepgram API (Speech-to-Text)</h4>\r\n194:                             <div class=\"config-row\">\r\n195:                                 <input type=\"password\" id=\"adv-deepgram-key\" placeholder=\"DEEPGRAM_API_KEY\">\r\n196:                                 <button id=\"save-deepgram-btn\" class=\"save-small\">Save Key</button>\r\n197:                             </div>\r\n198:                             <small class=\"config-hint\">Stored in <code>.env</code> file</small>\r\n199:                         </div>\r\n200: \r\n201:                         <div class=\"providers-table-container\">\r\n202:                             <table class=\"providers-table\">\r\n203:                                 <thead>\r\n204:                                     <tr>\r\n205:                                         <th>Provider</th>\r\n206:                                         <th>API Keys</th>\r\n207:                                         <th>Actions</th>\r\n208:                                     </tr>\r\n209:                                 </thead>\r\n210:                                 <tbody id=\"adv-providers-list\">\r\n211:                                     <!-- Providers will be generated here -->\r\n212:                                 </tbody>\r\n213:                             </table>\r\n214:                         </div>\r\n215: \r\n216:                         <div class=\"advanced-actions\">\r\n217:                             <button id=\"save-all-providers-btn\">Save All Provider Changes</button>\r\n218:                         </div>\r\n219:                     </fieldset>\r\n220:                 </div>\r\n221: \r\n222:                 <!-- Tab 4: Commands & Pro-Tips -->\r\n223:                 <div id=\"commands-tab\" class=\"tab-pane\">\r\n224:                     <div class=\"commands-layout\">\r\n225:                         <div class=\"pro-tips-section\">\r\n226:                             <div class=\"pro-tip-card\">\r\n227:                                 <h4>🥷 Stealth Professional Tip</h4>\r\n228:                                 <p>Always interact with the app using <strong>Global Hotkeys</strong>. Clicking on the\r\n229:                                     window during a proctored exam may trigger focus-detection alerts from monitoring\r\n230:                                     software.</p>\r\n231:                             </div>\r\n232:                             <div class=\"pro-tip-card vision\">\r\n233:                                 <h4>📸 Multi-Screenshot Analysis</h4>\r\n234:                                 <p>You can capture multiple screenshots with <kbd>Alt+S</kbd> to build a queue, then\r\n235:                                     process them all at once with <kbd>Alt+P</kbd>. This is highly recommended for\r\n236:                                     complex multi-part coding questions.</p>\r\n237:                             </div>\r\n238:                             <div class=\"pro-tip-card performance\">\r\n239:                                 <h4>⚡ Speed Strategy</h4>\r\n240:                                 <p>If your primary AI model is lagging, use <kbd>Alt+E</kbd> to immediately trigger\r\n241:                                     Auto-Select. Spectra will switch you to the fastest healthy provider available.</p>\r\n242:                             </div>\r\n243:                         </div>\r\n244: \r\n245:                         <div class=\"commands-grid\">\r\n246:                             <div class=\"command-category\">\r\n247:                                 <h5>🎭 Stealth & Appearance</h5>\r\n248:                                 <ul class=\"command-list\">\r\n249:                                     <li><kbd>Alt+X</kbd> <span>Toggle Ghost Mode (Click-through)</span></li>\r\n250:                                     <li><kbd>Alt+Z</kbd> <span>Toggle Visibility (Show/Hide)</span></li>\r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
